# Project Overview

This is a Vue.js-based Telegram Mini App template project. The project uses TypeScript and follows modern Vue 3 composition API patterns.

## Main Entry Points
- [src/main.ts](mdc:src/main.ts) - Application entry point
- [src/App.vue](mdc:src/App.vue) - Root Vue component
- [src/init.ts](mdc:src/init.ts) - Application initialization logic

## Key Directories
- `src/components/` - Reusable Vue components
- `src/pages/` - Page components for routing
- `src/composables/` - Vue composition functions
- `src/router/` - Vue Router configuration
- `src/tonconnect/` - TON Connect integration
- `src/helperts/` - Helper utilities
- `src/assets/` - Static assets

## Configuration Files
- [vite.config.ts](mdc:vite.config.ts) - Vite build configuration
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration
- [eslint.config.js](mdc:eslint.config.js) - ESLint configuration

## Development
- Use `pnpm dev` for local development
- Use `pnpm dev:https` for HTTPS development
- Use `pnpm build` for production build
- Use `pnpm lint` for linting
